flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Open database connection]
    B --> C[Create statement]
    C --> D[Create users table if missing]
    D --> E[Create accounts table if missing]
    E --> F[Create transactions table if missing]
    F --> G[Print success message]
    G --> H[Close resources automatically]
    H --> I[End]
    C --> J[On exception print stack trace]
    J --> I
